File Fabric: a failed upload returns an error instead of crashing

Why: UploadFile used the response without checking sendRequest's error, and sendRequest returned
no error once its retries ran out on an error status, so a refused or unreachable upload
dereferenced a nil body and crashed the whole process.
Test: TestFileFabricUploadFailsAfterRetries
Upstream: not submitted (upstreaming deferred, 2026-10-11).

